sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Reader
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant NX as Nginx proxy
    participant FC as FeedController
    participant CS as CacheService
    participant W as FeedCronWorker
    participant FF as FeedParserFactory
    participant P as RssParser / AtomParser
    participant EXT as External RSS feed

    rect rgb(244, 241, 234)
    note over W, EXT: Background harvest — runs every 15 minutes, off the request path
    W->>FF: createParser(feedUrl)
    FF-->>W: BaseParser subclass
    W->>P: parse(feedUrl)
    P->>EXT: HTTP GET feed XML
    EXT-->>P: RSS 2.0 / Atom 1.0 document
    P-->>W: IFeedItem[] (normalised)
    W->>W: sort by pubDate desc
    W->>CS: set(timeline:global, json, ttl 1800s)
    end

    rect rgb(232, 228, 216)
    note over U, CS: Read path — cache hit, no parsing, no external I/O
    U->>SPA: open timeline
    SPA->>NX: GET /api/feed
    NX->>FC: proxy request
    FC->>CS: get(timeline:global)
    CS-->>FC: cached JSON
    FC-->>SPA: 200 {source: REDIS_CACHE_HIT, latencyMs}
    SPA-->>U: render feed
    end

    rect rgb(250, 248, 245)
    note over FC, CS: Cold-start fallback — cache miss degrades to on-demand harvest
    FC->>CS: get(timeline:global)
    CS-->>FC: null
    FC->>W: executeFeedHarvest()
    W-->>FC: IFeedItem[]
    FC-->>SPA: 200 {source: ON_DEMAND_HARVEST}
    end
